{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "legend",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## How to read this canvas\nGreen = implemented module. Orange = abstract block, not RTL yet.\nArrow labels are the interconnect. Controls are drawn once and fan out.\n\nOpen [[Circular Row Buffer]] for the new source. This canvas is the port picture; [[Architecture.canvas]] remains the note map.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -300,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "controls",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## controls\nshared by every implemented block\n\n- clk\n- rst_n — sync, active low\n- clear_i — wins over valid_i\n\nNo ready/backpressure.\nDownstream must take every valid output.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 340,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "rowL",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## circular_row_buffer\ninstance: left image\n\n**in**\n- valid_i\n- pixel_i[PIXEL_W]\n\n**out**\n- valid_o\n- column_o[K*PIXEL_W]\n- row_last_o\n\nRing of K rows.\nOldest pixel = low slice.\nOne pixel per accept.",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "rowR",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## circular_row_buffer\ninstance: right image\n\nSame module, second instance.\n\n**in**\n- valid_i\n- pixel_i[PIXEL_W]\n\n**out**\n- valid_o\n- column_o[K*PIXEL_W]\n- row_last_o\n\nNo disparity shift inside.",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "controller",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## row controller\nnot a module yet\n\n**in**\n- row_last_o from each buffer\n\n**out**\n- stall the next window-row\n- engine clear_i after drain\n\nDrain is ceil(log2(K))+1 edges, then clear on its own edge.",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "align",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## disparity tap\nnot a module yet\n\n**in**\n- right column_o\n- disparity index\n\n**out**\n- right column at x-d\n\nKept outside the row buffer so the ring stays a plain image abstraction.",
      "x": 900,
      "y": 480,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "engine",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## sad_engine\nimplemented wrapper\n\n**in**\n- valid_i\n- left_column_i[K*PIXEL_W]\n- right_column_i[K*PIXEL_W]\n\n**out**\n- valid_o\n- sad_o[SAD_W]\n\nFixed alignment only.\nNo image memory inside.",
      "x": 1360,
      "y": 200,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "colsad",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## column_sad\ninside sad_engine\n\n**in**\n- valid_i\n- left_column_i\n- right_column_i\n\n**out**\n- valid_o\n- column_sum_o[COL_W]\n\nAbs differences, then a registered adder tree.\nLatency: ceil(log2(K)) after the sampling edge.",
      "x": 1820,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "colbuf",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## column_sum_buffer\ninside sad_engine\n\n**in**\n- valid_i\n- column_sum_i[COL_W]\n\n**out**\n- valid_o\n- sad_o[SAD_W]\n\nRing of K-1 column sums.\nFinal adder is H + new column.\nAlready inside this block.",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 40,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "winner",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## minimum comparator\nnot a module yet\n\n**in**\n- 32 sad_o values\n- their disparity indexes\n\n**out**\n- best disparity\n- best cost\n\nOne engine exists today. The bank is still one lane.",
      "x": 2300,
      "y": 520,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "note",
      "type": "file",
      "file": "Circular Row Buffer.md",
      "x": 440,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
